⠀⠀⠀⠀${c}⣴⡿${c}⣧⠀⠀⠀⠀ ⢠⣿⡄⠀⠀⠀⠀⢀⣾⢿⣆⠀⠀⠀
⠀⠀⠀⣼⡟${c}⠀⢹⣧⠀⠀⠀⣠⡿⠛⣿⡄⠀⠀⠀⣼⠏⠈⢿⡆⠀⠀
